{"2605790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep Rock Galactic: Rogue Core", "steam_appid": 2605790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4813580, 4216130, 4630280], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2d77ee05fea1ba13a818cf0a14fefe23.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2d77ee05fea1ba13a818cf0a14fefe23.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2d77ee05fea1ba13a818cf0a14fefe23.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our deep-level mining operations have gone dark.</strong> Deep Rock Galactic needs them back online at any cost. We’re sending in a crack squad of Reclaimers to breach and secure the mines, and kill whatever’s down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is not necessary for the success of this mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/a6ced04db9ebba39539a940caf8f36a5.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/a6ced04db9ebba39539a940caf8f36a5.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/a6ced04db9ebba39539a940caf8f36a5.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of the Reclaimers, Deep Rock Galactic’s elite corporate security force. In fast-paced <strong>1-4 player co-op gameplay</strong>, you’ll fight through alien-infested mines as five playable classes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GUARDIAN:</u></strong> The walking shield. An expert in area denial and close protection. Damages enemies with concussive blasts, and restores the team’s armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FALCONER:</u></strong> The aerial attacker. Deploys an airborne assault drone to electrify enemies. In an emergency, can even revive teammates from afar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RETCON:</u></strong> The hologram berserker. Can warp back to a previous point in spacetime, restoring health and ammo to recover from dangerous situations. Lethal in all time zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SPOTTER:</u></strong> The marksman. Highlights and weakens targets with toxin darts, spots enemies through walls, and can deploy ammo crates for use in extended firefights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SLICER:</u></strong> The melee expert. Carries an energy blade capable of dismembering all but the toughest opponents. Mobile, agile, aggressive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/1be2f1e84fd255bababd599dbb750a02.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/1be2f1e84fd255bababd599dbb750a02.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/1be2f1e84fd255bababd599dbb750a02.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two runs are the same.</strong> The roguelike format means you’ll scavenge your weapons and equipment from within the mines, and collect resources to upgrade your gear and abilities. Choose from a <strong>deep pool of upgrades</strong> for your weapons and abilities, discovering lethal synergies and snowballing in power as you fight your way down to the Rift Gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/e5aa827bce6650bc05bd1b843dd1f318.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/e5aa827bce6650bc05bd1b843dd1f318.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/e5aa827bce6650bc05bd1b843dd1f318.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linger too long, and the Reaperworms will hear you. Explore each level of the mine for upgrades, equipment and resources — but remember that each stop costs precious time. Stick with your team, move quickly, and push forward at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nobody said this would be easy.</strong> But death is only a setback. Dive, dig, die, and dive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/5cdba6505f48970c6bd4410668b41909.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/5cdba6505f48970c6bd4410668b41909.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/5cdba6505f48970c6bd4410668b41909.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally-generated caves</strong> mean every single mission gives a unique challenge of traversal and exploration. Featuring <strong>100% destructible terrain</strong>, you can dig, carve and explode the caves around you to level the playing field. Fight your way deeper through natural caverns and enormous industrial structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/23f86e3b4292bc4a223e251d556c17c0.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/23f86e3b4292bc4a223e251d556c17c0.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/23f86e3b4292bc4a223e251d556c17c0.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mines are infested with Corespawn: the most aggressive, resilient and intelligent alien life we’ve ever encountered on Hoxxes IV. <strong>20+ different enemy types and 3 different bosses</strong> are lying in wait. Use whatever means necessary to eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2138a7eb79a21f6ce77df711c2c3f0bb.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2138a7eb79a21f6ce77df711c2c3f0bb.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2138a7eb79a21f6ce77df711c2c3f0bb.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, you’ll find yourself aboard the RV-09 Ramrod. Here, you and your squad can access <strong>rich metaprogression and extensive character customization </strong>to bring into your next deployment<strong>. </strong>Lift weights, braid your beard, hit the dance floor, and have a beer with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/4f699707db0dae616bce524f988f724e.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/4f699707db0dae616bce524f988f724e.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/4f699707db0dae616bce524f988f724e.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve got what it takes to brave the depths? Wishlist Rogue Core and contact a local Reclaimers recruiting station today.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RESOLUTE. THE RELENTLESS. THE RECLAIMERS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2d77ee05fea1ba13a818cf0a14fefe23.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260579