img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/23f86e3b4292bc4a223e251d556c17c0.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/23f86e3b4292bc4a223e251d556c17c0.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/23f86e3b4292bc4a223e251d556c17c0.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mines are infested with Corespawn: the most aggressive, resilient and intelligent alien life we’ve ever encountered on Hoxxes IV. <strong>20+ different enemy types and 3 different bosses</strong> are lying in wait. Use whatever means necessary to eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2138a7eb79a21f6ce77df711c2c3f0bb.poster.avif?t=1787565124\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2138a7eb79a21f6ce77df711c2c3f0bb.webm?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605790/extras/2138a7eb79a21f6ce77df711c2c3f0bb.mp4?t=1787565124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, you’ll find yourself aboard the RV-09 Ramrod. Here, you and your squad can access <strong>rich metaprogression and extensive character customization </strong>to bring into your next deployment<strong>. </strong>Lift weights, braid your beard, hit the dance floor, and have a beer with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cl